    "name": "Atarude",
    "description": "<p>The binary is willing to talk, but only in hex and only on its own terms. It gives you a few local oracle lanes, then refuses to hand over the flag until you forge fresh ciphertexts for all of them.\nReverse the weird little <a href=\"/tasks/Atarude_e39d6ecbf3f6d04dee16fc4a9046770fa3bdd9f3.txz\"><strong>Atarude</strong></a>, find the hidden relations, and convince flag.enc that you belong here.</p>\n",
